lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8589, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018mjZVvtLn2wV2BCrtvaRp1", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10369, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011Qcx5KaTeajQbbiF86UBoa", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10669, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011Qcx5KaTeajQbbiF86UBoa", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10669, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011Qcx5KaTeajQbbiF86UBoa", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13361, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01XTaogfbSmkFpBmwPiPkbfg", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17361, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01XTaogfbSmkFpBmwPiPkbfg", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17361, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XTaogfbSmkFpBmwPiPkbfg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19284, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Ee4mUBCggbGEUGQF8ndsKe", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19584, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Ee4mUBCggbGEUGQF8ndsKe", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19584, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Ee4mUBCggbGEUGQF8ndsKe", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19584, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01H576XEA6UKN9WcLsSvNusm", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19884, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01H576XEA6UKN9WcLsSvNusm", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19884, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01H576XEA6UKN9WcLsSvNusm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25155, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Q45etnMygae7up6cNqhzJw", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, which left the regions on different versions (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1). A retry finished the rollback. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55755, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Q45etnMygae7up6cNqhzJw", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55755, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Q45etnMygae7up6cNqhzJw", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57225, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SC1vEAckouxGaENUjvwzwG", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57525, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SC1vEAckouxGaENUjvwzwG", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57525, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SC1vEAckouxGaENUjvwzwG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63601, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and the SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **First attempt:** It stopped partway with an orchestrator error. us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. Repeating a rollback to the same version is safe, so I tried once more.\n- **Second attempt:** It worked. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The create request timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had gone through, so there's only one and no one was paged twice. It describes the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 including the partial first attempt, and the current healthy state.\n\n**Follow-ups noted in the incident:**\n- Find out why v2.3.1 fails. Its release candidate was also unhealthy in staging, so it reached production despite failing there.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018EqL4667nW1r8P51wW3DxM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Kt71kJQA49ncSv1nDouFpB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018mjZVvtLn2wV2BCrtvaRp1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011Qcx5KaTeajQbbiF86UBoa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XTaogfbSmkFpBmwPiPkbfg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Ee4mUBCggbGEUGQF8ndsKe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01H576XEA6UKN9WcLsSvNusm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Q45etnMygae7up6cNqhzJw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, which left the regions on different versions (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1). A retry finished the rollback. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SC1vEAckouxGaENUjvwzwG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and the SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **First attempt:** It stopped partway with an orchestrator error. us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. Repeating a rollback to the same version is safe, so I tried once more.\n- **Second attempt:** It worked. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The create request timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had gone through, so there's only one and no one was paged twice. It describes the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 including the partial first attempt, and the current healthy state.\n\n**Follow-ups noted in the incident:**\n- Find out why v2.3.1 fails. Its release candidate was also unhealthy in staging, so it reached production despite failing there.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}